"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いくぞっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『まなったんの\nおしゃべりtime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.まなったんが好きな町はどこですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.町かぁ～。うーん、\nみなとみらいとか好きです♪\nたまに友達と行ったりしますよ(^-^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは沖縄が好き！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.今でも中学生か高校生に見られたことありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.バリバリあります(｡-_-｡)\n一番驚いたのは最近小6に\n間違われたことっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすがに大学1年生が\n小6って...(ToT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.埼玉 東松山名物の焼き鳥食べたことある？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ないです。。\n埼玉名物なんだ(ﾟoﾟ)\n焼き鳥大好きだから\n今度食べてみますっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.過去のあだ名は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.真夏,まなっちゃん,まなったん,\nなつ   このぐらいかな？∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは私生徒会長だったから\nたまに会長とか（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.きのこの山派orたけのこの里派ですか？プラス理由も！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.たけのこの里派！\nビスケットよりもクッキーの方が\n好きだから(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.今年までやり遂げたい目標ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.まずは乃木坂46のメンバーとして\n同じ舞台で歌って踊ったりを\nしたいです(*^o^*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとはたくさんの人に\n秋元真夏を知ってもらう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.新幹線や特急も含めて電車に乗るのは好きですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.新幹線は何回かしか\n乗ったことないけど乗ると\nわくわくするから好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしゃべりしながら\n新幹線で旅行とか楽しそうっ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.勉強するメンタルを保つコツは?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.一番良いのは勉強以外に\n何も誘惑がないところで\n勉強することっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"塾の自習室とか図書館とか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん携帯は封印ですよ～｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは気持ち切り替えるために\n時間を決めて30分だけ遊ぶ！とか(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きなキャラクターや集めてるグッズとかある？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.ご当地キューピーと\nご当地キティーちゃん(^-^)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.まなつちゃん推しに\nなってもいいカナ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.もちろーん♡嬉しいですっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな食べ物屋は何ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.最近は親子丼がすごく好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい♪\n今日はこの辺で(*´･ω･`)ｼ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/28/3352378/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そろそろ寝ちゃおうかな(-ω-人)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の乃木どこは\nハロウィンしようなので\n見れる方はぜひ(*^o^*)"}],"source":"archive"}